imonwillison.net/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-06-11\",\n    \"topics\": [\"Anthropic\", \"Claude Fable 5\", \"AI safety\", \"frontier LLM\", \"policy\"],\n    \"type\": \"opinion\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Datasette Agent 0.2a0 with user questions\",\n    \"description\": \"Tools can now ask user questions mid-execution using context.ask_user() for yes/no, multiple-choice, or free-text questions. Conversations suspend while questions are unanswered, persisting across server restarts. Built-in save_query tool saves SQL as Datasette stored queries with human approval.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-06-10\",\n    \"topics\": [\"Datasette Agent\", \"AI agents\", \"tool use\", \"user interaction\", \"SQL\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"DuckDB untrusted SQL security research\",\n    \"description\": \"Investigation into whether DuckDB can run untrusted SQL as safely as Datasette runs SQLite. Found DuckDB can be sandboxed to match SQLite safety but requires more than basic read_only=True. Datasette uses engine-level read-only and opcode-based time limits.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-06-10\",\n    \"topics\": [\"DuckDB\", \"SQLite\", \"security\", \"sandboxing\", \"SQL\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"DiffusionGemma open weight model\",\n    \"description\": \"Google's DiffusionGemma research returned as Apache 2 licensed open weight model (google/diffusiongemma-26B-A4B-it). NVIDIA hosting free on NIM cloud API. Generated image took 4.4s for 2,409 tokens (500+ tokens/second). Previously experimental Gemini Diffusion model from May 2025.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026